			<div class="content" id="post-content-2343958">
									

<p>2/2140 Clearance Confirmed&#8230;</p>
<p>The glyph image is by Petrograd. He used fonts by Juan Carlos Porcel from <a href="http://elderprops.tumblr.com/post/89934858272/free-fonts-necrofonticon2">http://elderprops.tumblr.com/post/89934858272/free-fonts-necrofonticon2</a>. All under CC.</p>
<p>The deep storage facility is Svalbard seed vault IMG 8887 by Bjoertvedt also CC.</p>
<p>Word count as of posting: 492.</p>
<p>I was vaguely inspired by <a href="http://escapepod.org/2015/06/01/ep494-the-retgun/">&quot;The Retgun&quot;</a> by Tim Pratt and <em><strong><a href="http://www.sjgames.com/gurps/books/madnessdossier/">GURPS Horror: The Madness Dossier</a></strong></em> by Kenneth Hite.</p>
<p>Thanks to Mr. Wrong, Eta Carinae, and especially psul and Petrograd for review!</p>
<p>Edit: Kallinikos was the guy who brought Greek Fire to Byzantium and oversaw the first known compartmentalized development of a weapon system.</p>

